  // "Position" is already in this table from the subtitle placement row, and one entry serves both.
  "Where the video’s centre sits, in pixels from the canvas’s centre. Drag the video on the stage to move it.": "កន្លែងដែលចំណុចកណ្ដាលវីដេអូស្ថិតនៅ គិតជាភីកសែលពីចំណុចកណ្ដាលផ្ទាំងស៊ុម។ អូសវីដេអូលើឆាកដើម្បីផ្លាស់ទី។",
