  "Select all lines": "ជ្រើសគ្រប់ឃ្លា",
  "Select this line": "ជ្រើសឃ្លានេះ",
  "Tick this line to regenerate or revoice only it — shift-click to tick a range": "ធីកឃ្លានេះ ដើម្បីបង្កើត ឬប្តូរសំឡេងតែវាមួយប៉ុណ្ណោះ — ចុច Shift ដើម្បីធីកជាជួរ",
  // ── The dialogue toolbar: find-and-replace, and the one-click male/female voice ──
  // 'Male' and 'Female' stand alone here as the two buttons' labels; the picker's 'Male voices' is
