  "Show the original line above each dub line": "បង្ហាញឃ្លាដើមនៅពីលើឃ្លានីមួយៗ",
  // Following the video down the table. 'Space' and 'Escape' stay in English like every other key.
  "Follow playback": "តាមការចាក់",
  "Highlight the line being spoken and scroll the table to it while the video plays — scrolling the table yourself pauses it for a few seconds": "បន្លិចឃ្លាដែលកំពុងនិយាយ ហើយរំកិលតារាងទៅរកវាពេលវីដេអូចាក់ — បើអ្នករំកិលតារាងដោយខ្លួនឯង វានឹងផ្អាកបន្តិច",
  // The same tickbox while a hand-scroll is being waited out. A whole label of its own rather than
